OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after boy, 4, dies in
OL,4,Aoff-road bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after a
OL,7,Ffour-year-old boy died in a crash
OL,8,Fbetween an off-road motorbike and a car
OL,9,Fin Newark.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said emergency
OL,12,Fservices were called to Churchill Drive
OL,13,Fat about 18:00 BST on Sunday.
OL,15,FThe boy, who was a passenger on the
OL,16,Foff-road bike, was declared dead at the
OL,17,Fscene.
