OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after boy, 4, dies in
OL,4,Aoff-road bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrian Cameron, 32, of Chatsworth Road,
OL,7,FNewark, has been charged with causing
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving and is due
OL,9,Fto appear at Nottingham Magistrates'
OL,10,FCourt on Wednesday, police said.
